h.append('<p class="note">No exact existing analysis was rerun just to create another copy. Audit status describes what existed before this work; final status describes the completed follow-up. The supplied MSI2 peak BED is treated as the reference set. Its endogenous origin is provisional because the user believes it is endogenous but an accession/publication is unconfirmed. All results below remain interpretable as coordinate analyses of that explicitly named reference.</p>')
